     {txt}                       outcome       mean
  1{com}. "Muscle recovery"      71.63
{txt}  2{com}. "Cramp reduction"      72.87
{txt}  3{com}. "Blood sugar support"  70.15
{txt}  4{com}. "Bone health"          63.82
{txt}  5{com}. "Sleep/relaxation"     74.36
{txt}  6{com}. end
{txt}
